  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>녹는점이라 잘 안될거라 예상은 했지만<br>데이터가 정말 둔탁(?)합니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b56aba7b434e596a8dc56a0c8b17be326922984b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b56aba7b434e596a8dc56a0c8b17be326922984b\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80323c908fd93c3f00f9b59a65dd2d7192c1ab65\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80323c908fd93c3f00f9b59a65dd2d7192c1ab65\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ca8f1d94ab4df580d4964ef0634421d3941f02e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ca8f1d94ab4df580d4964ef0634421d3941f02e\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a9d0d7fe2d77238f43662647636c1c220fbb348\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a9d0d7fe2d77238f43662647636c1c220fbb348\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68c77b4617272578b9d58b802960358c1529e5a2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68c77b4617272578b9d58b802960358c1529e5a2\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6d302fe852fa1c64e8770d910d9cb835723cc44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6d302fe852fa1c64e8770d910d9cb835723cc44\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a1f6cc651a8c9c81d72b95d75947e613ab1a47a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a1f6cc651a8c9c81d72b95d75947e613ab1a47a\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"><div class=\"figcaption\">팔미트산이 다 녹고 액체가 다 되어 온도가 더 올라가도.....</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">저 완만한 경사 구간이 녹는녀석과 액체녀석이 공존하는<br>현실적 그래프<br>(어떤 고체이든 위와 같이 녹는점이 나올것 같다.<br>즉, 현타~~ 현실적이다)<br><br>온도가 일정한 구간이 나오길 기다리는 학생들<br>팔미트산 녹는점을 알아온 아이들은 없고<br><br><br>&#8208;--------<br>이지메이커 센서로<br>팔미트산 녹는점 측정 실험을 해보았어요<br><br>교과서 나와서<br>해보니<br>온도가 일정한 구간이 나올질 않고<br>완경사를 가진 구간이 나오는 조가 있긴 합니다<br><br>핫플레이트를 <br>정말 정~ 말 정말 <br>더 서서히 뜨겁게 해야 할듯 보입니다<br><br>핫플레이트 레벨1 정도로 , 그럼 시간이 너무 오래 걸리는,<br>여튼 실험하기 좋지 않은...<br><br><br>녹는점보다 끓는점 실험을 추천합니다<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>--------------<br>&#160;<br>추가로 편집해서 사진을 올립니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6df8e73d7d15913d2580308c653a9004ef8d9abc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6df8e73d7d15913d2580308c653a9004ef8d9abc\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"><div class=\"figcaption\">화살표 표시한 구간이 온도가 일정해야 하는 구간입니다.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>-----<br>하나 더 추가</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b38afeca837a2db8c65ffc75d90250ae9b872e1b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b38afeca837a2db8c65ffc75d90250ae9b872e1b\" data-origin-width=\"3060\" data-origin-height=\"4080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">일정한 그래프가 그려진 조 의 그래프<br>4개반 28개 조 실험에서 1개조만<br>녹는점으로 알려진 온도 구간에서 <br>온도가 일정한 그래프가 나옵니다<br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
